{
 "source": "hand-written: which log entries of a request matched through path parameters carry pathParameters. Empty properties: its golden logs a forward's timing, which carries timeToFirstByteInMillis only on a new upstream connection, so it is recorded on an oracle of its own, whose forward connection pool is empty.",
 "properties": {},
 "steps": [
